 "root_cause": "Media sources stored the registered AID/CID, but later subtitle/stream requests looked up the current video CID and could publish replacement content under the old immutable source. Existing BV validation alone did not bind the registered asset.",
 "changes": [
  "Add a bound-source read port for subtitle/stream payloads and route all three media job operations through it",
  "Copy registered BV/AID/CID before the first await and compare fresh video metadata before subtitle/playurl dispatch",
  "Fail mismatches as bilibili_source_changed without downstream download/processing/artifact publication or rewriting the stored source",
  "Reuse the existing read workflow, credentials, account verification, time/queue bounds and cancellation cleanup",
  "Preserve ordinary owner reads and add only a delegating fake-port method to the shared fixture while retaining its unrelated raw WIP bytes"
 ],
